==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|en|hi|चाट}} (tasting, a delicacy), from {{m|hi|चाटना||to lick}}, from [[Prakrit]] चट्टेइ ''caṭṭei'' (to devour with relish, eat noisily).

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|ɑːt|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# any [[savory]] [[snack]], sold from a [[roadside]] [[stall]] in [[India]], or served as a [[starter]] in an Indian restaurant

